:: band {"position": "250,950", "size": "100,100"}
What does the information band look like?

The band should be flat and matte, with clear, legible text. 

(link: "❌ Band is shiny, text is not clear, stitched through the text")[(set: $flags to $flags + 1)(set: $flagnames to $flagnames + (a: "Fake-style information band"))(go-to: "hangar")]
|fakeBand1>[ <img src="images/band-fake.png" width="300" alt="Fake information band"> ](click: ?fakeBand1)[(set: $flags to $flags + 1)(set: $flagnames to $flagnames + (a: "Fake-style information band"))(go-to: "hangar")]

(link: "❌ Shorter Band")[(set: $flags to $flags + 1)(set: $flagnames to $flagnames + (a: "Fake-style short information band"))(go-to: "hangar")]
|fakeBand2>[ <img src="images/band-fake-short.png" width="300" alt="Fake information band (truncated)"> ](click: ?fakeBand2)[(set: $flags to $flags + 1)(set: $flagnames to $flagnames + (a: "Fake-style short information band"))(go-to: "hangar")] 

[[ ✅ Band is flat, text and stitching are clear and clean ->hangar]]
|imgLink1>[ <img src="images/band-legit.png" width="300" alt="Legit information band"> ](click: ?imgLink1)[(go-to: "hangar")]

(link: "🤔 I'm not sure")[(set: $unsure to $unsure + 1)(set: $unsurenames to $unsurenames + (a: "Information band check"))(go-to: "hangar")] 
